 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "vo01",
   "beat": "open",
   "text": "What if Earth spun faster, and couldn't stop?",
   "stars": [],
   "phonemes": null,
   "file": "01.wav",
   "dur": 3.51,
   "sha256": "209ecebc112234fdf15c0f216616445371fc5da8258606adeb4de6682870da1e"
  },
  {
   "id": "vo02",
   "beat": "s71",
   "text": "Only about seventeen times faster, a day of an hour and twenty-four minutes, and you leave the ground behind.",
   "stars": [],
   "phonemes": null,
   "file": "02.wav",
   "dur": 5.18,
   "sha256": "c38b4312782facb71a43193e03018ffe2d6170e10dc50e26b3a3ab08563debdf"
  },
  {
   "id": "vo03",
   "beat": "s72",
   "text": "That is the whole distance between standing and flying.",
   "stars": [],
   "phonemes": null,
   "file": "03.wav",
   "dur": 2.15,
   "sha256": "997d9055d30b5a4f65ceb3fdcdd7cc2f4fcd9e0a913fb4870b521dfee6a086b3"
  },
  {
   "id": "vo04",
   "beat": "s4",
   "text": "Only the spin changes, and it only gets faster.",
   "stars": [],
   "phonemes": null,
   "file": "04.wav",
   "dur": 2.38,
   "sha256": "0bbedec77c87fd0645f3bb1c6de8da6535b1157a4e86be643fff75a12712bc1a"
  },
  {
   "id": "vo05",
   "beat": "s12",
   "text": "What you feel is a tiny push outward: the spin makes you about a third of a percent lighter.",
   "stars": [],
   "phonemes": null,
   "file": "05.wav",
   "dur": 4.83,
   "sha256": "3256b870d8c6489740d2c8ba9f8607a235db79fa84ec7a26e805516c9f2c3c3f"
  },
  {
   "id": "vo06",
   "beat": "s13",
   "text": "Now the spin speeds up.",
   "stars": [],
   "phonemes": null,
   "file": "06.wav",
   "dur": 1.28,
   "sha256": "40564eae53bd86bf3c24041a080b62811936190319d412b689964676a7bae8fa"
  },
  {
   "id": "vo07",
   "beat": "cta",
   "text": "Hang on. If you're enjoying this, tap like and follow. Okay, back to the math.",
   "stars": [],
   "phonemes": null,
   "file": "07.wav",
   "dur": 5.11,
   "sha256": "e4527cfda3ba53e27b28101ffb005b988c52d0b5303f8e46e603f9aa22aa6f3e"
  },
  {
   "id": "vo08",
   "beat": "cliff",
   "text": "And then the spin has only just begun to speed up.",
